# Hackl in the café (D-105 axe rules; D-104: no H-box in Stage 9, so the
# Hackl is carried in). The test route of
# flow_m6_hackl_bad_ischl_to_cafe_zauner (the `hackl` level in Bad
# Ischl's slot, station 8 of 9) and its 2076 frames: the hackl run's
# Maibaum (1343), the tally, the route map, the Café Zauner intro (2016)
# drawn with Hackl Resi; play from 2166 as Hackl (score 5450, lives 3).
# She walks under the ?-box at 8 and the M-box at 12 (D-111) and hops
# onto the vitrine at 18-19 (2343); as Kellner #1 comes towards her she
# throws an axe (2369): it bounces off his tray (AxeHit 2408, no points,
# he walks on). A beam search (no hurt, Hackl kept, no RUN) to Vitrine D:
# down into pen 1, a tray bounce off Kellner #1 (2525) onto Vitrine A,
# a tray bounce off Kellner #2 (2690) onto Vitrine B, a stomp on Kurgast
# #1 (2798), Vitrine C, Vitrine D (2956). From its top she throws an axe
# over the queue (2987): it comes down on the third Wartender (col 79):
# defeated, 100 (3031).
# Then a beam search (no hurt, Hackl kept, no RUN) over seven Wartende
# (stomps 3067 ... 3334), the checkpoint (3491), the step and the
# Tortenvitrine onto the arena floor (3609); she walks to the arena's
# middle and the arena locks (3672, „Hinten anstellen!"). From the lock
# on the inputs are m7_boss_win_hackl's from its lock (468): an axe in
# his first telegraph bounces off the tray (AxeHit 3788, no points); she
# stays on the floor and jumps every dash as it passes under her (3824,
# 4049, 4268); one axe in each breather: hits at 3934 (left wall), 4156
# (right wall) and 4358 (left wall), 1000 + 1000 + 5000; right after the
# first hit a second axe flies through the stunned waiter (3939, no hit).
# Every breather is hit, so no volley comes. Then the counter: the armed
# goal_stollen (4547, 10 000); the replay ends in the Serve (4559).
